00:11:54.346 --> 00:11:57.724
Hold on, now. lt's a simple matter.

00:11:57.933 --> 00:12:01.937
Could you get your things together
and come to my place?

00:12:02.145 --> 00:12:03.146
Say what?

00:12:03.355 --> 00:12:05.398
I assure you, you 'll be treated with courtesy.

00:12:05.607 --> 00:12:09.903
You 'll be safe, well-off, and reasonably <i>free.</i>

00:12:10.111 --> 00:12:12.572
Huh?! l don 't know what you mean.

00:12:12.781 --> 00:12:16.034
Really? l think l explained it well enough.

00:12:16.243 --> 00:12:17.953
A-Are you making fun of me?!

00:12:18.161 --> 00:12:20.872
Then perhaps l should put it this way.

00:12:21.915 --> 00:12:25.001
My organization has decided to get serious.

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:26.586
