00:12:35.971 --> 00:12:39.057
Of course. And we're going
to keep causing you problems.

00:12:39.266 --> 00:12:45.021
What l ' m saying is, you 've gone too far.
Now our policies have changed.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:48.650
