00:13:20.515 --> 00:13:22.017
Just do it...

00:13:22.225 --> 00:13:26.855
That's kind of you,
but l happen to like my current life.

00:13:27.063 --> 00:13:30.900
And more importantly,
l would never go with you!

00:13:31.109 --> 00:13:33.820
I hate your guts!

00:13:35.864 --> 00:13:36.990
That's cold.

00:13:37.198 --> 00:13:39.367
Are you still angry about what happened?

00:13:39.576 --> 00:13:40.910
Didn 't you hear me?!

00:13:41.119 --> 00:13:42.662
But you said you 'd forgive <i>me.</i>

00:13:42.871 --> 00:13:43.663
Get lost!

00:13:43.872 --> 00:13:47.167
I 'll say this in closing, Kaname Chidori.

00:13:47.375 --> 00:13:49.919
You 're a chosen person.

00:13:50.128 --> 00:13:54.507
