00:13:55.884 --> 00:14:01.389
You must have noticed by now.
Those around you are hopelessly stupid.

00:14:01.598 --> 00:14:02.724
Get out!

00:14:04.934 --> 00:14:08.980
I will, then. Now you 've been warned.

00:14:10.357 --> 00:14:13.526
Oh, also... Sousuke Sagara.

00:14:13.735 --> 00:14:14.861
What?

00:14:16.946 --> 00:14:23.536
Casual investigation revealed
